      "property": "VerboseLogging",
      "key": "VerboseLogging",
      "kind": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Verbose logging (only for bug reports - slows the game)",
        "zhTW": "詳細記錄 (只在回報問題時開啟，會拖慢遊戲)",
        "zhTWFallback": false
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Logs every individual dispatch/reroute/redirect decision, not just summaries. Only useful when reproducing a bug for a report - writes a lot to disk.",
        "zhTW": "記錄每一個派遣/改道/重新導向的細節，不只是摘要。只有在為了回報問題而重現時才需要開啟，會大量寫入硬碟。",
        "zhTWFallback": false
      },
      "defaultValue": false
    },
    {
      "property": "ShowAdvancedTuning",
      "key": "ShowAdvancedTuning",
      "kind": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Show advanced tuning values",
        "zhTW": "顯示進階參數",
        "zhTWFallback": false
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reveals the numeric sliders inside each feature card. They are hidden by default because these values are calibrated against measurements from real play; changing them can stop a feature working without any visible sign.",
        "zhTW": "顯示每個功能卡片內的數值滑桿。預設隱藏，因為這些數值是依實機量測校準的；改動它們可能讓功能完全失效，而且不會有任何提示。",
        "zhTWFallback": false
      },
      "defaultValue": false
    }
