              "description": {
                "en": "A flat percentage-point bonus added on top of the multiplier above, so taxis stay a real option even where the base probability starts near zero.",
                "zhTW": "在上面的倍率之外再加上的固定百分點加成，讓計程車在基礎機率接近零的情況下仍然是個實際選項。",
                "zhTWFallback": false
              },
              "setting": "CitizenTaxiFlatBonus",
