      "features": [
        {
          "key": "feature.transitDwell",
          "id": "transitDwell",
          "setting": "TransitDwellShortenEnabled",
          "property": "TransitDwellShortenEnabled",
          "name": {
            "en": "Shorten empty stop dwell",
            "zhTW": "縮短空站停留時間",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "A bus that reaches a stop with nobody waiting to board leaves sooner instead of idling for the full fixed dwell. The stop is still served and everyone present still boards - only the waiting time with nobody coming is cut. Has no effect while Improved Public Transport or Express Bus Services is installed - IPT bundles Express Bus Services and patches departure timing itself, so this stands down for either. Both mods already decide when vehicles depart, and two of them writing the same timer would fight.",
            "zhTW": "巴士抵達沒有人等車的站點時提早離站，而不是固定停滿。仍然會停靠、仍然會載走現場所有乘客 —— 只縮短「沒有人再來」的那段等待。 安裝 Improved Public Transport 或 Express Bus Services 時本項無效 —— IPT 內含 Express Bus Services，本身也會改動離站時機，因此兩者任一存在時本項都會退讓。它們已經在決定車輛何時離站，兩邊同時寫同一個計時器會互相打架。",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "defaultEnabled": false,
          "sectionKey": "nav.experimental",
          "section": {
            "en": "Experimental",
            "zhTW": "實驗功能",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "group": "publicTransport",
          "status": "experimental",
          "tunables": []
        },
        {
          "key": "feature.transitUnbunch",
          "id": "transitUnbunch",
          "setting": "TransitUnbunchEnabled",
          "property": "TransitUnbunchEnabled",
          "name": {
            "en": "Unbunch vehicles on a line",
            "zhTW": "疏散同線車輛聚集",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "When a vehicle catches up with the one in front on the same line, it waits a little longer at the stop so the gap reopens - instead of the two running nose to tail with a long gap behind them. It holds back rather than skipping ahead, so no stop is ever passed and nobody is left behind. Has no effect while Improved Public Transport or Express Bus Services is installed - IPT bundles Express Bus Services and patches departure timing itself, so this stands down for either. Both mods already decide when vehicles depart, and two of them writing the same timer would fight.",
            "zhTW": "同一條路線的車輛追上前車時，會在站點多停一會兒讓車距重新拉開，而不是兩輛首尾相接、後面留下一大段空窗。它採取「壓後」而非「超前」，所以不會有任何站被跳過，也不會有人被丟下。 安裝 Improved Public Transport 或 Express Bus Services 時本項無效 —— IPT 內含 Express Bus Services，本身也會改動離站時機，因此兩者任一存在時本項都會退讓。它們已經在決定車輛何時離站，兩邊同時寫同一個計時器會互相打架。",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "defaultEnabled": false,
          "sectionKey": "nav.experimental",
          "section": {
            "en": "Experimental",
            "zhTW": "實驗功能",
            "zhTWFallback": false
          },
          "group": "publicTransport",
          "status": "experimental",
          "tunables": []
        },
